724,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-010.json","limitation":"Actually read cover-large/sheet-002.jpg. Jonathan Swift; Gullivers reizen; Kramers Klassieken. Front identity and source-edition attachment are corroboration, not proof of a visible barcode, printing year, language or complete contents. Bibliographic checks remain separate."}],"cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/6578724-L.jpg?default=false","edition_id":987215001,"bound_title":"Gullivers reizen","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T21:24:43.768+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789027491251","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p801594057","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-016","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"dut","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/6578724-M.jpg?default=false","bound_author_id":987315001},"before_row":null},{"key":{"id":987215003},"seq":4,"relation":"editions","after_row":{"id":987215003,"title":"De morte d''Arthur","isbn_10":"902749150X","isbn_13":"9789027491503","work_id":987115002,"cover_id":null,"language":"dut","publisher":"Het Spectrum","publish_date":null,"open_library_edition_id":"OL24354315M"},"before_row":{"id":987215003,"title":"De morte d''Arthur","isbn_10":"902749150X","isbn_13":null,"work_id":987115002,"cover_id":null,"language":"dut","publisher":"Het Spectrum","publish_date":null,"open_library_edition_id":"OL24354315M"}},{"key":{"work_id":987115002,"language":"nl"},"seq":5,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Thomas Malory brengt verhalen over koning Arthur en de ridders van de Ronde Tafel bijeen tot een omvangrijke vertelling. Daarin spelen onder anderen Merlijn, Guinevere en Lancelot een rol. Hij verwerkt uiteenlopende Franse en Engelse tradities tot een levensgeschiedenis van Arthur en zijn omgeving. De afzonderlijke avonturen laten zien hoe persoonlijke trouw en onderlinge verhoudingen het koningschap kunnen ondersteunen of bedreigen. Het werk is een middeleeuwse hervertelling van de Arthurstof, waarvan latere bewerkingen opnieuw gebruik hebben gemaakt.","work_id":987115002,"evidence":[{"note":"Exact1981Spectrum934p WimTigges translation, Caxtonforeword. Independent named library catalogue binds ISBN902749150X and complete Malory source, not a children’s retelling or KeithBaines version. Existing Work1474/edition1549 retained; only absent ISBN filled. Tigges translator and Caxton prefatory role are not primary authors.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p036435333"],"reference":"work:1474","checked_at":"2026-11-02T21:24:43.768Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-022.json","sources":["https://www.theosofie.nl/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Hoofdrubriek-Randgebieden-PDF-05-04-2022.pdf","https://www.boekwinkeltjes.nl/b/236446553/de-Morte-darthur-druk-1/","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL15450151W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p036435333"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"97d97faf079e4803b54b3565abc3b6799edb17e9344bb762d708fee7c5dfc4ae","cover_id":6578727,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-010.json","limitation":"Directly viewed decoded covers/6578727-large.jpg: Sir Thomas Malory; De Morte d’Arthur; top reads KLASSIEKEN with a torch emblem. Earlier Le/Kramers wording was a transcription error. Exact Dutch language, translator WimTigges,934p,ISBN and Spectrum binding are established separately by the bound KB/library records. Front alone does not assert a barcode or exact printing year."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://www.theosofie.nl/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Hoofdrubriek-Randgebieden-PDF-05-04-2022.pdf","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T21:24:43.768+00:00","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-016","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":987315002},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":987215003}